    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/6656b106572cef814d1d28bed3367843.poster.avif?t=1754637091\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/6656b106572cef814d1d28bed3367843.webm?t=1754637091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/6656b106572cef814d1d28bed3367843.mp4?t=1754637091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>In a word</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If Nintendo creates  a Soul-like game, I think it is .</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Short Description:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Move strategically or perish! <i>Slayer: The Demon Haunted World</i> is a thrilling action RPG where every move counts. Overcome challenging dungeons, battle relentless foes, and master the art of survival. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Brief story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The time of glory has passed, and a new era has begun.<br>Historian called this era &quot;The time of ash and dust&quot; <br>A Slayer Enter the tower to save the world  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/7d772b5bea4710651b71f57d3c2bd69d.avif?t=1754637091\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Slayer: The Demon Haunted World \u2013 A Tactical Action RPG</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What if <i>Nintendo</i> made a <i>Souls-like</i> action game? That\u2019s where <i>Slayer: The Demon Haunted World</i> began. Designed for players who love strategic movement and rewarding combat, this game challenges you to think before you strike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Tactical Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move one tile at a time, and attack only in the direction you're facing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master positioning, dodge traps, and time your attacks wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every encounter is a puzzle\u2014find the best way to defeat your enemies.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Distinctive Art Style</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eye-catching visuals that immediately stand out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A uniquely crafted world that blends fantasy and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/212629e782ef0735f8b3e902166d6dc8.poster.avif?t=1754637091\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/212629e782ef0735f8b3e902166d6dc8.webm?t=1754637091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/212629e782ef0735f8b3e902166d6dc8.mp4?t=1754637091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Accessible Yet Deep Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple controls allow anyone to jump in quickly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game naturally teaches its mechanics as you play\u2014no steep learning curve.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Growth &amp; Customization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level up your character, enhance stats, and collect powerful gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your build and refine your strategy with various skills.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Localized &amp; Ready for Global Release</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Available in <strong>Korean, English, and Japanese</strong> for a wider audience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stunning promotional music by an Italian composer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare for an adventure where survival depends on <strong>strategic movement and smart decision-making</strong>. Add <i>Slayer: The Demon Haunted World</i> to your wishlist now!\u00a0<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/bb5c957b4618ea9b34a150ee578be6a0.avif?t=1754637091\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
